  "mitigation": "Bypass Got response caching for max-stale requests after request hooks. Applies to built-in buffered/streaming requests, redirects and retries. Ordinary requests without caching or cache-enabling hooks retain the unguarded request path. Direct Got usage by custom code is outside the mitigation.",
